			"Message": "docs(Rest): Move uppercase documentation files to parent Documentation/Rest/ folder\n\n- Remove COMPILER.md, VERIFICATION.md, IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md, QUICK_REFERENCE.md, FINAL_STATUS.md from Element/Rest/\n- These files have been moved to Documentation/Rest/ for better organization\n- README.md remains in Element/Rest/ as component-level documentation",
